term-player — third-party code
================================

native/vendor/ contains DSP source code by Emilie Gillet from her open-source
eurorack firmware (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack, commit
see native/vendor/EURORACK_COMMIT) and the stmlib support library
(https://github.com/pichenettes/stmlib, see native/vendor/STMLIB_COMMIT):
the resonator (rings/), the granular processor and reverb (clouds/), and
stmlib's dsp/utils/fft helpers. Only the DSP parts are included; hardware,
firmware and UI files were removed.

